CM TM-WHP-NEC-010
CM 5.6m telescopic whip retracted — VHF/UHF (1.25m/70cm/33cm bands)
CM ---------------------------------------------------------------
CM Active configuration: 1.25m band (222-225 MHz), length=0.321m
CM
CM *** NEC-2 ACCURACY WARNING ***
CM NEC-2 is validated for HF and low VHF. Above ~300 MHz, wire-segment
CM approximations increasingly diverge from measured results due to:
CM   - Segment length/radius ratios approaching NEC-2 limits
CM   - Ground interaction models degrade at short wavelengths
CM   - Connector and feed geometry become significant at UHF
CM Results above 300 MHz should be treated as qualitative only.
CM For 70cm and 33cm design, use measured data or Method of Moments
CM solvers with higher-order basis functions (e.g. FEKO, CST).
CM
